{"errno":0,"errmsg":"","security":false,"data":{"id":"6164","title":"Xiaomi Auto Unveils Two New Additions to Xiaomi YU7 Family: Xiaomi YU7 Standard and Xiaomi YU7 GT","desc":"Xiaomi YU7 Standard offers exceptional value, while top-of-the-line Xiaomi YU7 GT with Track Package sets 7:22.755 Nürburgring lap record, delivering 1,003 PS and 705 km CLTC range ","view_cnt":"21427","like_cnt":"4","add_time":"1779367559","haslike":false,"image_url":["https://i02.appmifile.com/682_operatorx_operatorx_opx/21/05/2026/6b1e41e5bfad845abfd7f32287ee3bb5.jpg"],"video_url":"","ad":{"title":"","link":"","image_url":""},"content":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBeijing, CHINA, May 21, 2026\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;— Xiaomi Auto today unveiled two new additions to Xiaomi YU7 family, Xiaomi YU7 Standard and Xiaomi YU7 GT, featuring a comprehensive upgrade to its luxury high-performance electric SUV lineup. Xiaomi YU7 Series, positioned as a luxury high-performance family SUV, has earned widespread acclaim since its launch — achieving over 240,000 locked orders within the first 18 hours and delivering 232,000 units as of April 30th 2026, firmly establishing itself among the top-selling mid-to-large SUVs in Chinese Mainland.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi YU7 Standard starts at RMB\u0026nbsp;233,500, while Xiaomi YU7 GT — a track-bred SUV engineered for \"The Grand Tour\" — starts at RMB\u0026nbsp;389,900. Equipped with Xiaomi's latest electric powertrain technology and master-tuned chassis, Xiaomi YU7 GT with Track Package set a Nürburgring Nordschleife lap time of 7:22.755 on April 2, 2026, shattering the previous SUV lap record by a staggering 14 seconds.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDesign: Where Athletic Sculpture Meets Luxury Craftsmanship\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eClassic Long-Hood Proportions, Warhorse Stance\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi YU7 is a driver-focused luxury performance SUV that balances family comfort with athletic poise. Its exterior features classic long-hood proportions with a powerful, ground-hugging stance that delivers strong visual impact.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThree new exterior colors join the palette this year:\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/838_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/21/05/2026/1fe995b0e1a15ae8527cdf2ce9f5dc39.jpg\" alt=\"A red electric scooter is parked on the rooftop of a tall building in the city, surrounded by modern architecture, with a backdrop of a cloudy urban skyline. The ground is slippery, reflecting the surrounding light.\"\u003eCrimson Red: A rich, saturated wine-red infused with fine golden pearl particles that reveal layered metallic luster in sunlight and exude understated elegance in shadow.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/857_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/21/05/2026/08b4057767ed59f6ea48af57ff13ab3a.jpg\" alt=\"A purple sports car is driving along the seaside road, with a calm ocean and a soft sunset in the background.\"\u003eRadiant Purple: Continuing Xiaomi Auto's most popular color gene, this signature shade takes on a new level of refined depth on Xiaomi YU7's sculpted body.\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/844_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/21/05/2026/db0d64b5c4d9f8ed1c64847bf35a5d54.jpg\" alt=\"A gray sports car is parked on the city street, with modern glass curtain wall buildings in the background. The wheels have red brake calipers, and the overall design looks stylish and dynamic.\"\u003eVolcanic Gray: Inspired by mist-shrouded volcanic landscapes, this high-purity gray tone is infused with nano-scale mineral particles, creating a layered metallic texture as light shifts across the surface. Understated, sophisticated, and commanding a quiet presence, it exudes effortless elegance.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/46_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/21/05/2026/2f2f35160d0be8012ff0c8e732a5642a.jpg\" alt=\"A silver car is parked on the cobblestone road, next to it is a display of a 20-inch wheel, featuring a star-shaped rim and long-lasting tires, with a background of green trees and buildings.\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/415_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/21/05/2026/2fa6777d78934244c11c29eae85f05ca.jpg\"\u003eXiaomi YU7 adds the highly acclaimed Plum Blossom Rims and matching body-color Mi-Shaped Rims, which, together with the new Dawn Pink and Pearl White finishes, elevate the overall premium feel of the vehicle.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGT-Specific Design: Widebody, Carbon Fibre, and Aggressive Aerodynamics\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/703_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/21/05/2026/6d9195ccf8e14dda1cb98a4883149ec9.jpg\"\u003eXiaomi YU7 GT receives an exclusive widebody treatment with 295mm rear wide tires, a unified front splitter, active rear diffuser, 24K gold carbon fiber badges, and carbon fiber mirror housings. The family design language continues with signature cross-shaped headlights and halo taillights. Optional 21-inch forged two-piece wheels further enhance visual impact and handling precision. Xiaomi YU7 GT is available in five exclusive colors: Crimson Red, Obsidian Black, Titanium Silver, Pearl White, and Volcanic Gray.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi YU7 GT is available in five colors: Crimson Red, Obsidian Black, Titanium Silver, Pearl White, and Volcanic Gray.\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/661_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/21/05/2026/e77b13a1d7f07a59c87d30dc4c9b4d36.jpg\" alt=\"The red electric vehicle is parked on a flat road, with a background of green hills and rocks, showcasing the combination of natural scenery and modern technology.\"\u003eCrimson Red is rich, warm, and luminous with remarkable depth. In low light, it appears sophisticated and elegant. Under sunlight, it reveals a translucent pearlescent finish infused with fine metallic particles that create angle-dependent sparkle.\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/196_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/21/05/2026/94a21ef3cf2dd940a3260cd6a25947a8.jpg\" alt=\"A black sports car is parked in a spacious garage, the surrounding environment is dimly lit, with only the top lights illuminating the space, and the car's body reflects a faint sheen.\"\u003eObsidian Black delivers the ultimate classic blacked-out aesthetic.\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/329_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/21/05/2026/0bf6a2f68b6ad33b69bd1ac40f9344c7.jpg\" alt=\"A silver sports car is parked on the mountain road, with towering snow-capped mountains and dense forests in the background.\"\u003eTitanium Silver, the most popular color across Xiaomi YU7 lineup, continues onto Xiaomi YU7 GT.\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/125_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/21/05/2026/103293caa1f9dea243647d78e9a214db.jpg\"\u003ePearl White is a classic, versatile, and elegant finish that is particularly popular among female owners.\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/626_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/21/05/2026/2043526201d860624eb76c4f90dbc721.jpg\" alt=\"A black sports car is parked in front of a misty mountainous background, surrounded by hazy mountains, creating an atmosphere that feels mysterious and modern.\"\u003eVolcanic Gray is understated, sophisticated, and timeless.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePremium Customization\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAdditionally, Xiaomi Auto began piloting a premium customization service last year, allowing owners to create a truly unique vehicle. Xiaomi YU7 GT now adds three new premium custom paint finishes: Stealth Black (Matte), Titanium Silver (Matte), and Mercury Silver, showcasing the pinnacle of modern industrial aesthetics. A new Gentian Blue leather interior is also available for Xiaomi YU7 GT, drawing inspiration from luxury fashion color pairings for an even more upscale feel.\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/420_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/21/05/2026/97ad5b5c1a5fafab0e9ca32443dcfe47.jpg\" alt=\"It showcases three new custom color cars, namely: Stealth Black, Titanium Silver, and Mercury Silver. The design of each car reflects modernity and a unique style.\"\u003eFor wheels, customers can option 21\" Dual Five-Spoke Forged Rims for Xiaomi YU7 GT. Crafted through a forging process that involves milling with 20 different cutting heads over 11 hours of machining, followed by fine polishing, these wheels deliver greater strength and reduced weight.\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/427_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/21/05/2026/a34cb24c379d1c64fce75bcdab67e01b.jpg\" alt=\"A 21-inch dual five-spoke forged wheel is displayed, featuring red brake calipers, with an overall modern and sporty appearance. The background is dark, highlighting the design details of the wheel.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRacing\u0026nbsp;Red\u0026nbsp;Interior\u0026nbsp;and\u0026nbsp;Luxury Quiet Cabin: Performance and Serenity in One\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAs a C-segment performance SUV, Xiaomi YU7 offers generous interior space with comfortable seating for three in the rear. The cabin is designed with special attention to family users and female owners: all materials are infant-safe and pet-friendly (OEKO Standard I certified), with a HEPA high-efficiency air filter, magnetic accessory mounts, gentle airflow climate system, and hidden rear storage compartment, plus excellent NVH performance and heat-insulating, UV-protected glass, creating a quiet and comfortable travel environment for the whole family.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi YU7 GT deepens the integration of luxury and sport. All high-touch surfaces feature 100% soft-touch wrapping with extensive use of supercar-grade Alcantara, totaling 2.3 square meters, with up to 15 available carbon fiber trim pieces. Three GT-exclusive interior colorways — Racing Red \u0026amp; Blaze Black Dual-Tone, Ash Gray \u0026amp; Iris Purple Dual-Tone, and Blaze Black — are accented throughout with over a dozen GT badges, complemented by quilting craftsmanship and red seat belts. The entire cabin features five-screen connectivity, an exclusive GT theme with visual elements and animations perfectly integrated with the interior, plus GT sport sound with 40W external speaker, fully showcasing a technological edge.\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/714_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/21/05/2026/a6b6688fd596e119dfd0560398f1c1a5.jpg\"\u003eComfort is equally premium: the driver's seat features 18-way adjustment (including lumbar support, leg rest, cushion length, side bolsters, and even cushion side bolster electric adjustment) with active cornering bolsters that provide enhanced support. All four seats are equipped with 4-layer airbag massage systems (3 intensity levels, 6 massage modes) and ventilation with heating. The rear seats recline to 132 degrees with infinitely variable electric adjustment, and also feature ventilation and heating. Optional front dual zero-gravity seats ensure first-class comfort on long journeys. With the rear seats folded, cargo volume reaches 1,740 liters, keeping long journeys relaxed and comfortable.\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/374_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/21/05/2026/7ba392f79a3866f343a59780f074ff11.jpg\" alt=\"Driver's sport seat featuring 18-way adjustments, including backrest angle, seat height, cushion angle, electric lumbar support, and various bolster adjustments for customized comfort. The seats are designed with a sleek red and black aesthetic.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMaster Chassis + 1,003\u0026nbsp;PS: The\u0026nbsp;SUV\u0026nbsp;King of\u0026nbsp;Nürburgring\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi\u0026nbsp;Smart Chassis 2.0\u0026nbsp;Standard Across the\u0026nbsp;Lineup, Master Edition\u0026nbsp;Hardware\u0026nbsp;for\u0026nbsp;GT\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi YU7 Series comes standard with Xiaomi Smart Chassis 2.0, featuring a front double-wishbone and rear five-link independent suspension architecture deeply optimized for pure electric vehicle characteristics. The system incorporates sealed dual-chamber air springs and continuously damping variable shock absorbers, front double-wishbone and rear five-link suspension, four-piston fixed calipers, achieving a minimum turning radius of just 5.7 meters. The driving experience is refined and customizable, with multiple driving styles and independently adjustable steering feel. \"Sport+\" mode is designed for driving enthusiasts, while Comfort mode suits daily city commuting. A specially developed motion-sickness relief mode, which coordinates suspension damping, power delivery, and climate control, reduces motion sickness incidence by 51 percent, addressing a common concern among pure electric vehicle owners.\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/798_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/21/05/2026/691db2115fb45687d37172be849b8000.jpg\" alt=\"Xiaomi Smart Chassis 2.0 Master Edition features advanced automotive technology. It includes a front double-wishbone and rear five-link independent suspension, closed dual-chamber air springs with Dual-Valve CDC® for variable damping, an eLSD electronic limited-slip differential for torque vectoring, and a Track Package braking system with Akebono® calipers and large carbon-ceramic brake discs.\"\u003eXiaomi YU7 GT, equipped with the Xiaomi Smart Chassis 2.0 Master Edition, redefines performance expectations with supercar-grade hardware. Underpinning the YU7 GT's dynamic prowess is a suite of high-performance components. The SUV rides on dual-valve CDC variable dampers, employing the same dual-valve architecture trusted by leading automotive marques to deliver exceptional chassis control. This is complemented by a dual-chamber air suspension offering 75 millimetres of travel, which seamlessly balances plush ride comfort with precise body control across varying road surfaces. Further enhancing agility is an electronic limited-slip differential (eLSD), a first in the segment, that actively transfers torque between the left and right rear wheels with millisecond-level response times. Bringing Xiaomi YU7 GT to a decisive halt is a carbon-ceramic braking system shared with the Xiaomi SU7 Ultra, featuring Akebono six-piston front and four-piston rear fixed calipers that achieve a 100–0 km/h stopping distance of just 32.9 metres, maintaining stable braking performance even under continuous aggressive driving.\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/369_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/21/05/2026/bedc869d0aeb4cbd5bfbc3db0e709e7d.jpg\" alt=\"The image showcases a \u0026quot;Track Package Braking System\u0026quot; with three main features:\r\n\r\n1. **Ultra-large carbon-ceramic brake discs**: These can withstand operating temperatures over 1300°C.\r\n2. **Akebono® brake calipers**: Featuring a 6-piston setup in the front and a 4-piston setup in the rear.\r\n3. **Regenerative braking**: Capable of achieving a maximum deceleration of 0.6g with over 400kW peak power.\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNürburgring\u0026nbsp;Lap Record\u0026nbsp;7:22.755: King of the Corners\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi YU7 GT is the first production vehicle developed with deep involvement from technical experts at Xiaomi Auto's Europe R\u0026amp;D Centre. After two years of meticulous tuning by the team in Munich — staffed by engineers from leading performance brands — Xiaomi YU7 GT with Track Package delivered a stunning result on the legendary Nürburgring Nordschleife: a lap time of 7:22.755, smashing the previous SUV lap record by an astonishing 14 seconds. The lap was validated during official testing sessions at the legendary German circuit, further demonstrating Xiaomi Auto's growing capability in high-performance vehicle engineering.\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/159_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/21/05/2026/e7543021c9aef0939c8c5f13bf5a1587.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePowertrain: 1,003\u0026nbsp;PS\u0026nbsp;and 705 km — Performance Without Compromise\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e1,003 PS Super Powertrain: Redefining the Peak of Electric Performance\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi YU7 Standard delivers class-leading powertrain performance, accelerating from 0 to 100 km/h in 5.9 seconds and reaching a top speed of 220 km/h, making it perfectly capable of handling everyday driving scenarios from city commuting to highway passing.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi YU7 GT features a self-developed silicon carbide power module that increases effective current to 800A and improves power output by 13 percent. It also incorporates the industry's thinnest rotor silicon steel sheet at just 0.15mm, a 57 percent reduction in thickness compared to the previous V8s motor. Motor efficiency reaches 98.35 percent, with CLTC efficiency improving by 0.5 percent over the previous generation, equivalent to an additional 6.4 km of range. It is equipped with Xiaomi's latest-generation HyperEngine V8s EVO, with a maximum rotational speed of 28,000 rpm. Combined with a front and rear dual-motor system, it unleashes 1,003 PS, achieving 0–100 km/h in just 2.92 seconds and an astonishing top speed of 300 km/h.\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/495_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/21/05/2026/977dd8426e70c9f7455eec98bf25c36f.jpg\" alt=\"Xiaomi HyperEngine V8s EVO, claimed to be the \u0026quot;most powerful\u0026quot; engine to date, features a maximum speed of 28,000 rpm, a peak output of 450 kW, and a peak torque of 540 N·m.\"\u003eThe braking system delivers performance even more capable than the vehicle's acceleration, providing substantial safety margin. Xiaomi YU7 GT comes standard with the same track-grade braking system as Xiaomi SU7 Ultra, featuring Akebono six-piston calipers and carbon-ceramic brake discs rated for operating temperatures up to 1,300°C, achieving a 100-0 km/h stopping distance of 32.9 meters. The system also delivers 10 consecutive 180-0 km/h braking stops with no fade, releasing three times the energy of a single 100-0 km/h stop, as well as two consecutive 300-0 km/h extreme braking stops. Combined with the Xiaomi Smart Chassis 2.0 Master Edition, dual-valve CDC variable damping, and sealed dual-chamber air springs, it achieves a perfect balance between extreme sportiness and exceptional comfort, delivering an ultimate driving experience whether on the racetrack or during long-distance cruising.\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/352_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/21/05/2026/6923fe59cb04c4c86de61e1894a8ef67.jpg\" alt=\"The image displays a sleek red car in motion, highlighting its braking performance at various speeds. Key details include:\r\n\r\n- **100-0 km/h**: Minimum braking distance of 32.9 meters.\r\n- **180-0 km/h**: Ability to perform 10 consecutive braking stops without fading.\r\n- **300-0 km/h**: Capability of 2 consecutive extreme braking stops.\r\n\r\nThe background suggests a dynamic driving environment.\"\u003eThe electronic limited-slip differential (eLSD) intelligently limits rear axle left-right wheel speed differential in milliseconds, automatically distributing drive force to wheels with traction. This torque vectoring capability reduces drive force loss during cornering, delivering faster and more stable cornering speeds.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUltra-High-Voltage Platform: High Performance Meets Long Range\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi YU7 Standard is equipped with a 73 kWh lithium iron phosphate battery on a 752V silicon carbide high-voltage platform, delivering a CLTC range of 643 km. A 15-minute fast charge provides 385 km of range, more than sufficient for daily urban commuting needs.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi YU7 GT features a 101.7 kWh ternary lithium battery on an 897V ultra-high-voltage platform with a 5.2C high-rate charging architecture, delivering a CLTC range of 705 km. An intelligent front motor decoupling system adds an extra 20 km of range in Eco mode, achieving a true balance between high performance and long-distance capability, ensuring the great journey is never out of reach.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIntelligence and Safety\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAll-Scenario Smart Experience with Lifetime Free Access to Advanced\u0026nbsp;Driver\u0026nbsp;Assistance\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi YU7 Series features an extra-large panoramic display, Xiaomi HyperVision, and a fully upgraded XiaoAi AI Voice Assistant, along with a new AI pet companion, delivering smooth, natural in-car interaction and caring emotional companionship. The entire lineup comes standard with an advanced driver assistance system powered by a NVIDIA DRIVE AGX Thor computing platform delivering 700 TOPS of computing power, complemented by LiDAR and 4D millimeter-wave radar, as well as the latest version of Xiaomi HAD (Hyper Assisted Driving). This enables full-scenario assistance including highway navigation, urban navigation, and automated parking. The practical voice-activated exterior parking function is standard across all variants, and all driver assistance features are free for life with no subscription fees.\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/734_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/21/05/2026/738641a59d98bdfcf7ba9419cb8bf940.jpg\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSafety First: Building a Mobile\u0026nbsp;Safe\u0026nbsp;Haven\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Auto has always prioritized user safety above all else. Xiaomi YU7 Series incorporates an embedded roll cage constructed from 2,200 MPa ultra-high-strength steel, achieving industry-leading body torsional rigidity. The door handles feature a triple-redundancy safety design, ensuring that even under extreme conditions such as dual battery disconnection, an independent backup power supply supports in-cabin unlocking, complemented by an exterior mechanical pull handle.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor battery safety, Xiaomi YU7 Series battery pack has undergone over 1,200 rigorous tests, including a double dual-needle battery puncture test equivalent to 400,000 kilometers of real-world use, safeguarding users on every journey.\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/194_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/21/05/2026/e84f32156ea8c4bdc3a9012845cba6e9.jpg\" alt=\"The image outlines various safety features of a vehicle, categorized into five sections:\r\n\r\n1. **Passive Safety**: Focuses on structural integrity and materials, aiming for high safety ratings.\r\n2. **Active Safety**: Includes standard safety assistance features for safe driving.\r\n3. **Battery Safety**: Highlights protective measures for battery systems.\r\n4. **Driving Safety**: Lists driving modes and safety systems to enhance control.\r\n5. **Privacy Safety**: Emphasizes data security and user privacy measures.\r\n\r\nThe overall theme is \u0026quot;Safety Above All.\u0026quot;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003ePricing and Availability\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eAvailable in Chinese Mainland, Xiaomi YU7 Series redefines the benchmark for pure electric SUVs, with Xiaomi YU7 Standard starting from\u0026nbsp;RMB\u0026nbsp;233,500\u0026nbsp;and Xiaomi YU7 GT starting from\u0026nbsp;RMB 389,900.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi YU7 not only redefines the performance boundaries of pure electric SUVs but also strives to bring joy to every journey. Test drive experiences are now available at all Xiaomi Auto retail locations nationwide.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAbout Xiaomi Corporation\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Corporation was founded in April 2010 and listed on the Main Board of the Hong Kong Stock Exchange on July 9, 2018 (1810.HK). Xiaomi is a consumer electronics and smart manufacturing company with smartphones, smart hardware, and smart electric vehicles connected by an IoT platform at its core.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eEmbracing our vision of \"Make friends with users and be the coolest company in the users' hearts\", Xiaomi continuously pursues innovations, high-quality user experience and operational efficiency. The Company relentlessly builds amazing products with honest prices to let everyone in the world enjoy a better life through innovative technology.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi is one of the world's leading smartphone companies. In December 2025, the MAU reached 754.1 million (including smartphones and tablets) globally. The Company has also established the world's leading consumer AIoT (AI+IoT) platform. As of December 31, 2025, the number of IoT devices connected to its platform (excluding smartphones, laptops, and tablets) reached 1,079.2 million. In October 2023, Xiaomi upgraded its strategy to \"Human × Car × Home\" smart ecosystem, seamlessly merging personal devices, smart home products, and cars. The Company has rapidly emerged as a leading innovator in the smart electric vehicle industry, reaching profitability within six quarters of commencing deliveries and delivering over 600,000 units by February 2026. Xiaomi always centers on humanity and is committed to providing comprehensive, better connected experiences. Xiaomi products are present in more than 100 countries and regions around the world. In July 2025, Xiaomi was included in the Fortune Global 500 list for the seventh year in a row, ranking 297th.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi is a constituent of the Hang Seng Index, Hang Seng China Enterprises Index, Hang Seng TECH Index and Hang Seng China 50 Index.\u003c/p\u003e","product_list":null,"shareCnt":"516","material_type":"newsroom","online_time":"1779367564"},"common":null}